### Desactivar solicitudes de reprogramación — el resto de ajustes no cambia (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveJobsSettings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "allowRescheduleRequest": false
}

### Activar el cambio automático de estado: solicitudes de reprogramación (5) → Cancelado (7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveJobsSettings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autoCancelStuckJobsEnabled": true,
  "autoCancelStuckJobsWindowId": 3,
  "autoCancelStuckJobsSourceStatuses": [5],
  "autoCancelStuckJobsTargetStatus": 7
}

### Activar sin ventana → 400 "Debe seleccionar una ventana de tiempo..."
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveJobsSettings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autoCancelStuckJobsEnabled": true
}

### Destino dentro de los estados de origen → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/saveJobsSettings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autoCancelStuckJobsEnabled": true,
  "autoCancelStuckJobsWindowId": 3,
  "autoCancelStuckJobsSourceStatuses": [5, 7],
  "autoCancelStuckJobsTargetStatus": 7
}
